{"4183130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DOPAMINE", "steam_appid": 4183130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ROLL ROLL ROLL</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to roll <strong>DIE!!!!</strong> Gamble your life away alone or with up to 3 friends!  Score high! No HIGHER! I SAID HIGHER!!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the ever more rediculous thresholds, and make it to the end, and maximize your DOPAMINE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/d0679190100def7e2212241c7e7cd684.poster.avif?t=1784132272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/d0679190100def7e2212241c7e7cd684.webm?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/d0679190100def7e2212241c7e7cd684.mp4?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>BUILD BUILD BUILD</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannons! Fans! Bounce pads! Magnets Grenades! Guillotines! And much, MUCH MORE! Build a perfect crazy contraption for all the zany action your little heart can take! The more you roll, the more you score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f46a46ece42a156e15eafd1afe890ade.poster.avif?t=1784132272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f46a46ece42a156e15eafd1afe890ade.webm?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f46a46ece42a156e15eafd1afe890ade.mp4?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>SCORE SCORE SCORE</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We cannot possibly stress enough the importance of constructing optimal paths to achieve ludicrous scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f3566f796b7a1684beec072dcd66c7fb.poster.avif?t=1784132272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f3566f796b7a1684beec072dcd66c7fb.webm?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f3566f796b7a1684beec072dcd66c7fb.mp4?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MAKE FRIENEMIES</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fucking around is optional. Fun is mandatory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/2f649937796ab65fbc44f2bb767c1319.poster.avif?t=1784132272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/2f649937796ab65fbc44f2bb767c1319.webm?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/2f649937796ab65fbc44f2bb767c1319.mp4?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Psychedelic Rogue-lite Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online 1-4 Player Co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-Based Dice Rolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score Points by Rolling Die in a Contraption of your Own Creation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and Discover New Items in the Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll Physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricks and Traps to mess with your friends!<br> </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ROLL ROLL ROLL</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to roll <strong>DIE!!!!</strong> Gamble your life away alone or with up to 3 friends!  Score high! No HIGHER! I SAID HIGHER!!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the ever more rediculous thresholds, and make it to the end, and maximize your DOPAMINE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/d0679190100def7e2212241c7e7cd684.poster.avif?t=1784132272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/d0679190100def7e2212241c7e7cd684.webm?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/d0679190100def7e2212241c7e7cd684.mp4?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>BUILD BUILD BUILD</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannons! Fans! Bounce pads! Magnets Grenades! Guillotines! And much, MUCH MORE! Build a perfect crazy contraption for all the zany action your little heart can take! The more you roll, the more you score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f46a46ece42a156e15eafd1afe890ade.poster.avif?t=1784132272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f46a46ece42a156e15eafd1afe890ade.webm?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f46a46ece42a156e15eafd1afe890ade.mp4?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>SCORE SCORE SCORE</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We cannot possibly stress enough the importance of constructing optimal paths to achieve ludicrous scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f3566f796b7a1684beec072dcd66c7fb.poster.avif?t=1784132272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f3566f796b7a1684beec072dcd66c7fb.webm?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/f3566f796b7a1684beec072dcd66c7fb.mp4?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MAKE FRIENEMIES</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fucking around is optional. Fun is mandatory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/2f649937796ab65fbc44f2bb767c1319.poster.avif?t=1784132272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/2f649937796ab65fbc44f2bb767c1319.webm?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/extras/2f649937796ab65fbc44f2bb767c1319.mp4?t=1784132272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Psychedelic Rogue-lite Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online 1-4 Player Co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-Based Dice Rolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score Points by Rolling Die in a Contraption of your Own Creation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase and Discover New Items in the Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll Physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricks and Traps to mess with your friends!<br> </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "ROLL ROLL ROLL! An online 1-4 player co-op physics-based “rube-goldberg-like” gambling game! Place ramps, cannons, turrets, and other contraptions in the name of maximum Dopamine. Unlock zany items to harass your friends, avoid dangerous side effects of gambling, and survive the clinic trial…", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/82694bb965d10bfd65ad6f37822d5a90fe297bba/header.jpg?t=1784132272", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/c16ec95b334b4b50cb5b712b8914d7125315c3eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784132272", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4183130/c16ec95b334b4b50cb5b712b8914d7125315c3eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784132272", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bi